&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;margin-top:2pt;margin-bottom:2pt;line-height:13pt;"&gt;東京証券取引所マザーズ市場へ株式上場&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
